{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1000_016tsu", "source_sha256": "056f2f9908a9d98dc3623a1d870401cc9b61ef1e5802263ecf1db6efae286d40", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さんだ～。\nお疲れさまで～す♪", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生～\n你辛苦了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a08862ec78932fce12e9a517dc0640d1bceda562a6dee52aa110427d84f1b1d0", "ja": "お疲れさま、翼。新しい衣装はどうだ？\nなにか気になるところがあったら、言ってくれよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，翼。新服装还好吗？\n如果有什么在意的地方，记得跟我说喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "41b573069f571fe27863df1a87f5c2eaab15b90f2c7c8f0702034620712ab7cc", "ja": "む～。{$P$}さんってば、\n他に言うことないんですか～？", "zh": "唔～{$P$}先生真是的，\n你都没有其他想说的话吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6ed6cce2a992ff2d9ffbe73ffa44ad44b0e795683e8af4b3e7452046713f54d2", "ja": "え？　……ああ、そうだったな。\nカワイイ衣装だな、翼によく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "咦……哦，对了。\n真是可爱的服装呢，很适合翼喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1a1c6e35449d2ac9026971d6517c545c724cd8ff87be096d55a001ac98e73786", "ja": "えへへ…♪　{$P$}さんも、そう\n思いますか？　この衣装、わたしにピッタリですよね！", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪{$P$}先生也这么觉得啊？\n这套服装真适合我呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0bf00abd9565827bc900ea4e589cd7b4d635072b7dfad7940e15eab02073a747", "ja": "すっごくカワイイし、デザインはカッコイイし。\nあと、オヘソが見えてセクシーだし！", "zh": "不但超可爱，设计得也很帅气。\n而且看得到肚脐，别有魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4e8d087bd89439bfc8df1fad3411d5ee5800232abd4a4a19b979fe9d1b626d1b", "ja": "たしかに、お腹のあたりを大胆に見せてるんだな。\n健康的なセクシーって感じで、いいと思う。", "zh": "确实是完全露出肚子的大胆设计呢。\n有股健康的魅力，我觉得很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "725fb56a5c9d15ff62f36f1d425ec93e4e55372a0dd76c42f448abbcdc2eb60c", "ja": "そうなんですよ～。でも、ちょっとでも太ったら、\n一発でバレちゃうから、油断できないんですよね～。", "zh": "就是说啊～不过这样一来，\n只要稍微胖了就会马上被发现，所以不能大意～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b799533f8c3fb0e4ddcfa1637fa8bef1abbe24f0720473268746d788341db3d0", "ja": "なら、しばらくは食べ過ぎは禁物だな。\n今日も寄り道しないで、おとなしく帰るんだぞ？", "zh": "那么，这阵子就不能吃太多了呢。\n今天也别四处乱逛，要直接回家喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "61bd811bba650ca6621ec7687ce4a6a75294b7426428378bf698ce1b3b4f6d14", "ja": "え～、そんなのつまんない～！　\nせっかくだから、一緒にお茶して帰りましょうよ～。", "zh": "咦～那样好无聊～！　\n难得有时间，我们一起喝杯茶再回家嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "990ee42b2722a5752233345a3eb29db73cbf965ad50c1779ee50c72e3f6f83d1", "ja": "近くに新しくできたお店のパンケーキ、すっごく\n美味しいんだって♪　雑誌に載ってたんですよ～。", "zh": "听说这附近新开的店，松饼超好吃的♪\n杂志上都有写喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0034_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0c5e7b0f159a471ae1fac1fb84b7761cdac22488ea5f676780d4172bf9bed72a", "ja": "油断できないんじゃなかったのか……。", "zh": "你不是说不能大意吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
